5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about the roads. Last winter, the closures north of the river disrupted everything.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,The location of our branches dictates who can actually reach us. We must consider access.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,Why do we keep guessing? We have records of what worked before. Let’s look at the past.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The budget looks fine now, but I suspect it will crumble by year two. I need to see the terms.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,"We are adding more work, but do we have the skills? I need to check the staff roster.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, you are right. The past is a good teacher. I will check the winter road closures.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, agreed. I will look at the bus links in the outer wards to see who is cut off.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Benjamin, I will check the two programmes begun six years ago. We need to know what actually stuck.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, I will examine the county grant terms and the endowment. The funding shape is the real risk.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, I will review the volunteer register and supervision training. We need to know who can lead.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will also look at the attendance sheets from former outreach stops. We need to know who showed up.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will also check the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use. When do people actually need us?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will also look at the running and equipment lines last year. I want to see the real costs.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will also check the quoted delivery windows from suppliers. Delays kill budgets.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will also check the neighbourhood associations and tool certification. Who is actually qualified?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I am ready to see what the data says. Let us hope it is kind.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will wait for the findings. The geography is the first constraint.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I am excited! Let’s see if the old ideas were really bad or just forgotten.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I will review my findings before we vote. Logic must guide us.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,I will stick with my two choices. We cannot hire for skills we do not have.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
